### Main
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main=Guidebook
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main=§lWelcome to Digital Miner Addon.§r\nIn this book you will learn how to craft and use the items of this Addon.\n\n

### Main/How Work
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work=How It Work
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work=See how the features of this Addon work.\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner=Digital Miner
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner=After crafting your §eDigital Miner§r, you can place it on the ground, but make sure that:\n§l>§r It has a free area of at least 3x3 blocks wide and 2 blocks high.\n§l>§r For it work, you will need to place a chest behind the Miner and add a filter.\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner/Filter
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner.filter=Filters
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner.filter=Filters are an essential part, as this is where you will define which blocks the Miner will collect.\nThey can be specified by §bType§r or §bTag§r.\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner/Filter/Type
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner.filter.type=Type
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner.filter.type=The §eType Filters§r can be specified by:\n§l>§r Writing the block ID (when the namespace is not specified, "minecraft:" will be used)\n§l>§r The type of block you are holding when you click the button.\n\nExemple: "deepslate_diamond_ore", "iron_ore", "stone", "oak_log"\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner/Filter/Tag
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner.filter.tag=Tag
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner.filter.tag=The §eTag Filters§r currently, only can be specified by:\n§l>§r Writing the block tag. If you don't know the tags, there's a list with some custom Tags.\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner/Filter/Remove
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner.filter.remove=Remove
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner.filter.remove=To remove the §eFilters§r is simple: Select which filters you want to remove and submit. They will be removed quickly.\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner/Upgrades
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner.upgrades=Upgrades
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner.upgrades=The §eUpgrades§r help the §eMiner§r to unlock the potential it was designed to have.\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner/Upgrades/Speed
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner.upgrades.speed=Speed Upgrade
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner.upgrades.speed=The §eSpeed Upgrades§r reduce the time between each §eMiner§r operation, being:\n§lTier 1§r = §s15 Seconds\n§r§lTier 2§r = §s10 Seconds\n§r§lTier 3§r = §s5 Seconds\n§r§lTier 4§r = §s1 Second\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner/Upgrades/Stack
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner.upgrades.stack=Stack Upgrade
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner.upgrades.stack=The §eStack Upgrades§r increase the amount of blocks broken per §eMiner§r execution, being:\n§lTier 1§r = §s2 Blocks per Execution\n§r§lTier 2§r = §s4 Blocks per Execution\n§r§lTier 3§r = §s6 Blocks per Execution\n§r§lTier 4§r = §s8 Blocks per Execution\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner/Upgrades/Fortune
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner.upgrades.fortune=Fortune Upgrade
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner.upgrades.fortune=The §eFortune Upgrades§r increase the number of items generated by each block broken by the §eMiner§r, being:\n§lTier 1§r = §sFortune 1\n§r§lTier 2§r = §sFortune 2\n§r§lTier 3§r = §sFortune 3\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner/Upgrades/Silk Touch
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner.upgrades.silk_touch=Silk Touch Upgrade
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner.upgrades.silk_touch=The §eSilk Touch Upgrade§r allows the §eMiner§r to collect the blocks with the enchantment silk touch.\nThere is only one upgrade level.\n\n

### Main/How Work/Digital Miner/Settings
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.digital_miner.settings=Settings
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.digital_miner.settings=The settings are simple, you can configure:\n§l>§r The Miner's operating radius to the sides, from §e0§r to §e32§r blocks.\n§l>§r The minimum operating height of the Miner, from §e-64§r to §e320§r §i(Y coordinate)§r\n§l>§r The maximum operating height of the Miner, from §e-64§r to §e320§r §i(Y coordinate)§r, this variable will never be less than the minimum height.\n\n

### Main/How Work/Ore Scanner
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.how_work.ore_scanner=Ore Scanner
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.how_work.ore_scanner=After crafting your §eOre Scanner§r the nearby ore will be highlighted with an outline showing their location.\n§l>§r Interact with it in your hand while crouching down to open the ore screen so the scanner can search.\n§l>§r To search for new ores in a new area, interact again but without being crouched.\n\n

### Main/Craft
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft=Craft
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft=Learn how to make machines, tools, and much more.\n\n

### Main/Craft/Machines
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.machines=Machines
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines=There are currently 2 machines: The Digital Miner and the Ore Scanner.\n\n

### Main/Craft/Machines/Digital Miner
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.machines.digital_miner=Digital Miner - Recipe
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner=To make the §eDigital Miner§r you'll need:\n§r§l4§r = §sSteel Plates\n§r§l1§r = §sMonitor\n§r§l1§r = §sDigital Processor\n§r§l1§r = §sMotor de Máquina\n§r§l1§r = §sLaser Drill\n§r§l1§r = §sRedstone Block\n\n

### Main/Craft/Machines/Digital Miner/Resource Amount
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.resource_amount=Total Resources
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.resource_amount=List with the total resources:\n§r§l999§r = §sCoal§i | 15 Stacks + 39\n§r§l995§r = §sRaw Iron§i | 15 Stacks + 35\n§r§l588§r = §sRaw Gold§i | 9 Stacks + 9\n§r§l215§r = §sRedstone§i | 3 Stacks + 23\n§r§l80§r = §sDiamonds§i | 1 stack + 16\n§r§l11§r = §sStones\n§r§l10§r = §sQuartz\n§r§l9§r = §sAmethyst Shards\n§r§l4§r = §sGlowstones\n§r§l2§r = §sSands\n\n

### Main/Craft/Machines/Digital Miner/Monitor
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.monitor=Monitor
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.monitor=To make the §eMonitor§r you'll need:\n§r§l4§r = §sIntegrated Circuits\n§r§l4§r = §sSteel Ingots\n§r§l1§r = §sDiamond Glass\n\n

### Main/Craft/Machines/Digital Miner/Monitor/Integrated Circuit
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.monitor.integrated_circuit=Integrated Circuit
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.monitor.integrated_circuit=To make the §eIntegrated Circuit§r you'll need:\n§r§l4§r = §sCapacitors\n§r§l4§r = §sSteel Nuggets\n§r§l1§r = §sRedstone\n\n

### Main/Craft/Machines/Digital Miner/Monitor/Integrated Circuit/Capacitor
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.monitor.integrated_circuit.capacitor=Capacitor
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.monitor.integrated_circuit.capacitor=To make the §eCapacitor§r you'll need:\n§r§l2§r = §sSteel Nuggets\n§r§l2§r = §sRedstone\n§r§l1§r = §sGold Ingots\n\n

### Main/Craft/Machines/Digital Miner/Monitor/Diamond Glass
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.monitor.diamond_glass=Diamond Glass
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.monitor.diamond_glass=To make the §eDiamond Glass§r you'll need:\n§r§l8§r = §sDiamond Dusts\n§r§l1§r = §sGlass\n\n

### Main/Craft/Machines/Digital Miner/Digital Processor
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.digital_processor=Digital Processor
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.digital_processor=To make the §eDigital Processor§r you'll need:\n§r§l4§r = §sAdvanced Circuits\n§r§l1§r = §sSteel Plate\n§r§l2§r = §sGold Plates\n§r§l2§r = §sDiamond Plates\n\n

### Main/Craft/Machines/Digital Miner/Digital Processor/Advanced Circuit
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.digital_processor.advanced_circuit=Advanced Circuit
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.digital_processor.advanced_circuit=To make the §eAdvanced Circuit§r you'll need:\n§r§l2§r = §sIntegrated Circuits\n§r§l4§r = §sDiamond Plates\n§r§l2§r = §sRedstone Enriched Quartz\n§r§l1§r = §sAmethyst Shard\n\n

