ui.digital_miner:guidebook.title.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.digital_processor.advanced_circuit.redstone_enriched_quartz=Redstone Enriched Quartz
ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.digital_processor.advanced_circuit.redstone_enriched_quartz=To make the §eRedstone Enriched Quartz§r you'll need:\n§r§l8§r = §sRedstones\n§r§l1§r = §sQuartz\n\n

