ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.machine_engine=To make the §eMachine Engine§r you'll need:\n§r§l3§r = §sSteel Blocks\n§r§l2§r = §sRedstone Blocks\n§r§l1§r = §sCoal Block\n§r§l1§r = §sBlast Furnace\n\n

