ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.laser_drill=To make the §eLaser Drill§r you'll need:\n§r§l1§r = §sSteel Plate\n§r§l2§r = §sSteel Ingots\n§r§l2§r = §sRedstone Enriched Quartz\n§r§l1§r = §sLight Generator\n§r§l1§r = §sDiamond Glass\n\n

