ui.digital_miner:guidebook.body.main.craft.machines.digital_miner.laser_drill.light_generator=To make the §eLight Generator§r you'll need:\n§r§l1§r = §sSteel Block\n§r§l4§r = §sGlowstones\n§r§l4§r = §sAmethyst Shards\n\n

